  # Vietnam to establish a national AI development fund, complete AI ecosystem
  
  [![Facebook Share](https://vovworld.vn/themes/custom/vov_5/images/Facebook.svg)Facebook](https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fvovworld.vn%2Fnews%2Fvietnam-to-establish-a-national-ai-development-fund-complete-ai-ecosystem-2424954.vov5)
  
